+
+### Bound Wraith: per-class Bound Wraith skins (patch 0417)
+```discord-update
+Dev Update | Bound Wraith
+
+- Added Bound Wraith, a second skin set for every hero class: bone-and-gunmetal plate, spirit-fire crests, glowing eyes and blades that burn spectral teal
+- Added Bound Wraith unlocks: clear The Bonewrought Vault on Heroic or harder with a hero in the party to earn that class's Bound Wraith
+- Added a Bound Wraith section to Heroes > Skins, with a 7,500 gold unlock per class once earned
+- Clears from before this update count too, if they're still in your raid history
+```
+
+Direct request: a full "Bound Wraith" set across all 14 classes, built
+from a ChatGPT knight mockup whose look was good but whose animation was
+not, so the theme was rebuilt on the working sprite frames instead.
+Decisions locked in conversation: same conditions as the Frost Court
+(patch 0415), tied to **The Bonewrought Vault on Heroic or harder** with
+that class in the party; priced higher at **7,500 gold per class**; no
+Steam achievement.
+
+**Data-only on top of the 0415 per-class system.** One new skins.json
+entry, `bound_wraith` (cost 7500, swatch `#2fd3a8`/`#3a2f5c`,
+`perClass: true`, `unlockRaidId: "bonewrought_vault"`,
+`unlockMinDifficulty: "heroic"`). Nothing in code changed:
+`earnFromRaidClear` already loops every perClass SkinDef, so a Heroic+
+Vault clear earns `bound_wraith:<class>` for the party (and a Wyrmkeep
+clear still earns only Frost Sovereign). `backfillFromRaidLog` picks up
+qualifying Vault clears already in raidLog on next load. HeroesPanel
+renders one `.class-skin-set` section per perClass skin, so Bound Wraith
+appears under Frost Sovereign automatically. COMPLETE_WARDROBE already
+excludes perClass skins.
+
+**Art (not in git -- `public/heroes` is gitignored, licensed pack):**
+`public/heroes/<class>/bound_wraith/*.png`, all 84 sheets across the 14
+classes (every animation each class has, for the same IdleView attack-
+flash reason as 0415). Knight is hand-tuned (`wraith.py`): bone helmet
+over gunmetal body, red plume -> teal spirit flame with animated tongues,
+skull face with glowing eyes, bone crest, slate shield with grey rim and
+cross, teal glowing blade, chest rune, ragged indigo cape hem, trailing
+wisps. Other 13 classes (`wraithpack.py`, reusing themepack's per-class
+head tracking): palette ramps metal / ash / indigo / spirit-teal / iron
+(blue-grey steel maps to metal so plate stays gunmetal rather than
+going violet), animated spirit-flame crest off the head or headgear top,
+near-white weapon pixels turned glowing teal with a halo, glowing eyes,
+faint teal aura and looping wisps. Generator scripts live outside the
+repo with the Frost Court ones.
+
+**Verified** in the web build with a mid-game save: two per-class
+sections show in Heroes > Skins; a Heroic Bonewrought Vault full clear
+with a 6-hero party earned `bound_wraith:` for all six classes and no
+Frost Sovereign entries; unlocking the Knight version took 7,500 gold
+and added `bound_wraith:knight` to classSkinsOwned; no console errors.
